    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc9fAdd in WishList!!\ud83d\udc9f</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/7cc4ed07fcd3861a4a8075d062dcfe92.poster.avif?t=1750385840\" width=616 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/7cc4ed07fcd3861a4a8075d062dcfe92.webm?t=1750385840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/7cc4ed07fcd3861a4a8075d062dcfe92.mp4?t=1750385840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Falter in battle, and this shrine maiden won't stay pure for long...</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Game Progression</strong></u></h2><br>A dungeon crawl necessitates preparation. Give Saki the best equipment available and prepare her for whatever may come her way.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/3acf0f2f7bc5c40b33bf29da60507697.avif?t=1750385840\" width=616 height=462 /></span><br><br>In her crawl through the dungeon, Saki will do battle with abonimations who will go after her body to seize victory.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/5927d61b6e77499e3f94c9b176d3d4dc.avif?t=1750385840\" width=616 height=462 /></span><br><br>But it's not just demons Saki has to deal with. She must also navigate her way through devious traps.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/7704ff906a85a804387f71119535bdb8.avif?t=1750385840\" width=616 height=462 /></span><br><br>The further she ventures in, the more abominable the demons will become. It'll take every bit of her power at her disposal to exorcise them for good.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/28f6ece7ea74f42f2767efd1ce7cddcd.avif?t=1750385840\" width=616 height=462 /></span><br><br><strong>Tapping into her divine power, Saki harbors a miraculous ability to transform</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/6c829fe3c6e8f0eca51baec27674b2e9.avif?t=1750385840\" width=616 height=466 /></span><br><br><u>Standard Form</u>   <u>Fox Spirit Form</u><br><br><u>Berserker Form</u>   <u>Snowflake Form</u><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Erotic Battles</strong></h2><br>Saki's foes will attempt to restrain and then defile her. Once restrained, Saki will be raped without mercy! Let it continue, and her defilement will only become even more servere and thorough.<br><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/eeb1f27496cb4f8c949854c86df2b9ad.poster.avif?t=1750385840\" width=616 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/eeb1f27496cb4f8c949854c86df2b9ad.webm?t=1750385840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/eeb1f27496cb4f8c949854c86df2b9ad.mp4?t=1750385840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Features, contents and others</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>\u25bcFeatures</u></h2><br>\u30fbExplore linear dungeons either manually or on full auto.<br>\u30fbNo game overs in battles.<br>\u30fbAnimated sex scenes in battles.<br>\u30fbExplict images and sound effects can be turned off seperately.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>\u25bcContent</u></h2>\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501<br>\u30fbContains around 71 sex CGs (12 of which for when a battle is lost)<br>\u30fbAround 59 looped sex animations during battle and for all enemies<br>\u30fbSex animations in all battles.\u3000<br>\u30fbFree battle mode included.<br>\u30fbFeatures voice acting by Shiki Asagi<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/6d052f2d0ded29b00113357303c46867.poster.avif?t=1750385840\" width=616 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/6d052f2d0ded29b00113357303c46867.webm?t=1750385840\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2652500/extras/6d052f2d0ded29b00113357303c46867.mp4?t=1750385840\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
